---
import SiteLayout from '../../layouts/SiteLayout.astro';
---

<SiteLayout title="Team | WeCollab8" description="Meet the people bringing practical engineering experience to WeCollab8 projects.">
  <section class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-5 pb-20 pt-16 md:px-8 md:pb-24 md:pt-20 lg:px-10">
    <p class="eyebrow">The people behind the work</p>
    <div class="mt-5 grid gap-10 md:grid-cols-[0.9fr_1.1fr] md:items-start">
      <h1 class="max-w-[12ch] font-display text-5xl leading-tight text-ink md:text-6xl">Experience across the enterprise stack.</h1>
      <div class="border-t border-line pt-5">
        <p class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-normal text-rust">Director</p>
        <h2 class="mt-3 font-display text-3xl text-ink">Roger D'Souza</h2>
        <p class="mt-4 max-w-2xl text-base leading-8 text-muted">Roger's career spans enterprise monitoring and automation, infrastructure management, IT service management and cloud-native technologies. He takes a practical approach to finding efficiencies, with a focus on automation.</p>
        <a href="/team/roger-dsouza/" class="text-link mt-6 inline-block text-sm font-semibold text-forest">More about Roger &rarr;</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</SiteLayout>